! Chapter 10 example: excited-state character of DMABN (4-(dimethylamino)benzonitrile)
! Step 1: S0 opt+freq   Step 2: TD (coefficients >= 1e-4 printed for Multiwfn)
! Steps 3-4: NTOs of S1 and S2 (each written to its own chk)   Step 5: DCT index of S2
%chk=dmabn_opt.chk
%mem=8GB
%nprocshared=8
#p B3LYP/6-31+G(d) EmpiricalDispersion=GD3BJ Opt Freq SCRF=(SMD,Solvent=Acetonitrile)

DMABN S0 opt+freq, B3LYP-D3(BJ)/6-31+G(d), SMD(acetonitrile)

0 1
